# A long mixed session (editing in Today, star, done, move to another project, indent, color, copy and paste) is undone step by step back to the exact original file.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
	- Prepare slides @due({today+1})
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
keys gt <Enter>
type  online
keys <Esc> * j x gh j gm
type home
keys <Enter> <Tab> c2 G y gg p
see ▌ - Review pull requests
keys z z z z z z z z z z z z z z
see ▌   - Renew passport
hide online
quit
saved <<END
INBOX:
	- Call the plumber
	- Renew passport @due({today-3})
Work:
	- Write quarterly report @due({today-2})
	- Review pull requests
	- Prepare slides @due({today+1})
Home:
	- Fix the shelf
	- Pay rent @due({today-7})
END
